Line 8 currently checks `at <= end;`. This means the end time is *inclusive*. The requirement states it must be *exclusive*. It should be `at < end`.

The requirement also states it must count *distinct wafer IDs*. The current function counts the *number of records* within the time range, not the distinct wafer IDs.

